{"id":418,"date":"2023-07-05T23:36:23","date_gmt":"2023-07-05T23:36:23","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/?p=418"},"modified":"2026-05-21T20:31:41","modified_gmt":"2026-05-21T20:31:41","slug":"lane-bryant","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2023\/07\/05\/lane-bryant\/","title":{"rendered":"Lane Bryant"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\">Lane Bryant<\/h1>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Role:<\/strong> In-House Art Director, Email Marketing <strong>Scope:<\/strong> Email Campaign Design &amp; Production<\/p>\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Overview<\/h2>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Lane Bryant is one of the most recognized names in plus-size fashion, serving millions of customers across the U.S. As an in-house Art Director, I led the design and production of email marketing campaigns that drove engagement and sales across the brand&#8217;s customer base.<\/p>\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">The Work<\/h2>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">I concepted, designed, and produced a high volume of promotional email campaigns \u2014 from seasonal pushes to time-sensitive flash sales. The work required balancing brand standards with the urgency of retail calendars, translating merchandising priorities into visual storytelling that moved customers to act.<\/p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Every campaign had to feel fresh while staying unmistakably on-brand \u2014 bold, inclusive, and built for Lane Bryant&#8217;s loyal, fashion-forward audience.<\/p>\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Impact<\/h2>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">One of my flash sale email designs proved so effective that it continued to be used by the team after my departure \u2014 a testament to the strength and versatility of the creative. Good design doesn&#8217;t clock out when you do.<\/p>\n<hr class=\"border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5\" \/>\n<h2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold\">Disciplines<\/h2>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Email Design \u00b7 Art Direction \u00b7 Retail Marketing \u00b7 Campaign Production<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/images.milledcdn.com\/2022-05-21\/hCD8j2o7vqfCNO7y\/3cnQNxOgMDM1.gif\" width=\"600\" height=\"831\" \/><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/SIm5_bgjU16.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/images.milledcdn.com\/2022-06-01\/0iZUr8fJwqHSDEab\/Lold7UzsD9Pr.gif\" width=\"599\" height=\"908\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/screencapture-milled-lanebryant-1-slow-your-scroll-all-tops-10-and-up-A3514F6Ufz0e9W3L-2023-03-16-17_01_13-1-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"423\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/2023\/07\/05\/lane-bryant\/screencapture-milled-lanebryant-1-slow-your-scroll-all-tops-10-and-up-a3514f6ufz0e9w3l-2023-03-16-17_01_13-1\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/mikelwashington.com\/work\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/screencapture-milled-lanebryant-1-slow-your-scroll-all-tops-10-and-up-A3514F6Ufz0e9W3L-2023-03-16-17_01_13-1-scaled.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"729,2560\" da